          "draft": {
            "heroMessage": "Guiding you home in Silver Valley and North Idaho.",
            "welcomeNote": "Welcome to Cindy Carlson Realty. Whether you’re seeking land, recreation, business, or your dream home in our scenic region, our team is here to support your real estate journey with expertise and care.",
            "tagline": "Deep roots. Trusted service. Local expertise.",
            "aboutParagraph": "With over 18 years of experience in residential and commercial real estate and more than four decades living and working in the area, Cindy Carlson blends local insight with a reputation for service, integrity, and community commitment. Cindy has led Silver Valley in sales and listings for years, continually investing in the people and organizations that make this area special. Her advanced real estate designations and ongoing education reflect her dedication to the best possible service for every client. Cindy Carlson Realty is proud to be part of the Silver Valley community and to connect clients to the outstanding lifestyle throughout North Idaho.",
            "conciergeLine": "From first inquiry to final signature, Cindy and her dedicated team are always ready to make your move a seamless experience.",
            "contactLine": "Ready to buy or sell in North Idaho? Connect with Cindy directly at (208) 512-0078 or cindy@cindycarlsonrealty.com.",
