  "finalBuildScreen": "Building your app\nLIVE IMPORT ACTIVITY\nReading Cindy Carlson Realty\nMatching your website’s design and imagery\nRead 2 linked pages\nIdentified your profile photo\nSorted 5 website images by role\nWriting your profile and app copy\nFound 8 active listings\nRead full details for all 8 listings\nSaved 8 listings",
  "reviewText": "Back\nAPP BUILDER\ncindycarlsonrealty.com\nChange\nHere’s your app\nYour branding, content and listings are ready to review. Explore themes or preview your app before publishing.\nCindy Carlson Realty\nKELLOGG, ID\nWelcome To Cindy Carlson Realty\nCindy Carlson Realty A Full Service Real Estate Agency located in Kellogg Idaho.\nTHE AREA\nNorth Idaho’s Silver Valley\nNestled in the foothills of the Rocky Mountains, in the heart of the Panhandle National Forest, the Silver Valley is most noted for its mining heritage, dating back to the 1880s. The Silver Valley is also famous for it’s Ski Resorts ~ Silver Mountain and Lookout Pass; it’s Bike Trails, ATV Trails and The World’s Longest Gondola. The narrow valley, about 40 miles in length, comprises a number of small towns along the South Fork of the Coeur d’Alene River and Interstate 90.\nABOUT\nCindy Carlson, Broker, Realtor ® , ABR, CRS, GRI, RSPS, RPAC Major Investor\nCindy Carlson, Broker/owner of Cindy Carlson Realty, located in Kellogg, Idaho, is a 18 year residential/commercial real estate veteran. With deep roots to this area, Cindy and her husband Denny, have raised their family and enjoyed this scenic area for over 40 years. After 25+ years as a well known figure at a local dentist office, she decided to take her personal skills and stellar work ethic and turn it into a real estate career.\nProperty Search:\n$429,000\n409 Emerald Dr\n4 beds · 2.5 baths · 2,129 sq ft\n$325,000\n6113 Prichard Creek ST\n3 beds · 1 baths · 1,472 sq ft\n$1,299,999\n483 Paradise Lane\n3 beds · 1.5 baths · 3,183 sq ft\n$64,000\n50 S Breeden Ave\n2 beds · 1 baths · 624 sq ft\n$388,000\n604 W Cameron Ave\n4 beds · 1.5 baths · 2,382 sq ft\n$220,000\n301 S Division St\n1 baths · 792 sq ft\n$130,000\nNKA May Court\nCataldo, ID\n$99,500\n11 & 13 Kingston WAY\nKingston, ID\n(208) 512-0078\ncindy@cindycarlsonrealty.com\nCindy Carlson Realty\nHome\nListings\nSaved\nChat\nProfile\nMy Website · how your clients will see the opening screen\nOPENING LINE\nGuiding you home in Silver Valley and North Idaho.\nTry another opening line\nYOUR INTRODUCTION\nWith over 18 years of experience in residential and commercial real estate and more than four decades living and working in the area, Cindy Carlson blends local insight with a reputation for service, integrity, and community commitment. Cindy has led Silver Valley in sales and listings for years, continually investing in the people and organizations that make this area special. Her advanced real estate designations and ongoing education reflect her dedication to the best possible service for every client. Cindy Carlson Realty is proud to be part of the Silver Valley community and to connect clients to the outstanding lifestyle throughout North Idaho.\nTry another introduction\n8 listings imported from your website.\nYour portrait\nShown on your app’s first screen.\nAdjust or replace photo\n▸ Brokerage & license (optional)\n✓ Cindy Carlson Realty\nMake it yours\nExplore themes with your imported content and listings, or preview the client experience. Publish whenever you’re ready.\nExplore Themes\nPreview My App\nPublish My App",
